  "details": "`VRCPlayerApi.GetAvailableLanguages()` returns `en, fr, it, de, es, ja, ko, pt-BR, he, pl, tp, id, zh-CN, zh-HK, ru` on l-test build 1405. `tp` must be Toki Pona. However, according to ISO 639-3, the identifier of Toki Pona is `tok`.\n\nAlthough this is not an ordinary issue here (Localization board), I report it because it must be a latent defect.\n\nRefer:\n\n- https://iso639-3.sil.org/code/tok\n\n- https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IETF_language_tag",
